ersection are $\\left(\\frac{1}{2},-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)$." 13194139545761 17592186576411 true] [17592186697865 1080 "\\langle \\frac{5}{2},-\\frac{1}{2},1\\rangle" 13194139545761 17592186576411 false] [17592186697865 1080 "\\left\\langle \\frac{5}{2},-\\frac{1}{2},1\\right\\rangle" 13194139545761 17592186576411 true] [17592186697866 1074 "The matrix represents the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y-z &=2 \\\\ y-\\frac{1}{2}z &=0 \\\\ z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe bottom equation gives $z=1$.\n\nSubstitute the known values into the next equation above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1\\right)&=0 \\\\ y&=0 + \\frac{1}{2}\\left(1\\right) \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\nSubstitute the known values into the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)-\\left(1\\right)&=2 \\\\ x&=2 + \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) + \\left(1\\right) \\\\ x&=\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\nThus the solution vector is $\\langle \\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2},1\\rangle$." 13194139545761 17592186576411 false] [17592186697866 1074 "The matrix represents the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y-z &=2 \\\\ y-\\frac{1}{2}z &=0 \\\\ z &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe bottom equation gives $z=1$.\n\nSubstitute the known values into the next equation above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1\\right)&=0 \\\\ y&=0 + \\frac{1}{2}\\left(1\\right) \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\nSubstitute the known values into the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)-\\left(1\\right)&=2 \\\\ x&=2 + \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) + \\left(1\\right) \\\\ x&=\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\nThus the solution vector is $\\left\\langle \\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2},1\\right\\rangle$." 13194139545761 17592186576411 true] [17592186697870 1080 "\\langle -\\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2},1\\rangle" 13194139545761 17592186576411 false] [17592186697870 1080 "\\left\\langle -\\frac{7}{2},\\frac{1}{2},1\\right